        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Make Mine Music; Old Dogs; Peter and the Wolf\n- People: Walt Disney; Walt Becker; John Travolta; Robin Williams; Kelly Preston; Matt Dillon; Justin Long; Seth Green; Rita Wilson; Dax Shepard; Lori Loughlin; Bernie Mac\n\nFacts:\n- Make Mine Music is a 1946 American animated anthology film produced by Walt Disney and released to theaters on April 20, 1946.\n- Peter and the Wolf is a 1946 film that was originally released theatrically as a segment in Make Mine Music.\n- Old Dogs is a 2009 American ensemble comedy film directed by Walt Becker.\n- Old Dogs stars John Travolta and Robin Williams.\n- Old Dogs has an ensemble supporting cast including Kelly Preston, Matt Dillon, Justin Long, Seth Green, Rita Wilson, Dax Shepard, Lori Loughlin, and Bernie Mac.",
